      "Provides a comprehensive introduction to artificial intelligence spanning foundational machine learning through advanced applications including deep learning, generative AI, autonomous systems, and robotics. Explores AI's evolution and business applications across finance, marketing, manufacturing, supply chain, and human resources. Examines ethical, regulatory, and governance considerations including bias, privacy, and responsible implementation. Equips business professionals and technology leaders with technical understanding and strategic skills to navigate AI's transformative impact and leverage AI-driven solutions effectively.",
